{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23541","headline":"宣武令狐相公以诗寄赠传播吴中聊奉短草用申酬谢 · 白居易","name":"宣武令狐相公以诗寄赠传播吴中聊奉短草用申酬谢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新诗传咏忽纷纷，楚老吴娃耳徧闻。\n尽解呼爲好才子，不知官是上将军。\n辞人命薄多无位，战将功高少有文。\n谢朓篇章韩信钺，一生双得不如君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23541.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23541","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}